&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;DACH Campaign and Events Manager&lt;/strong&gt;, you will be responsible for leading Redwood&#39;s regional marketing strategy across the DACH market by localizing global campaigns, driving demand generation, supporting strategic partnerships, and collaborating closely with sales and global marketing teams to accelerate pipeline growth and strengthen Redwood&#39;s presence in the region.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
