&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 style=&quot;font-family: GothamBold,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; color: #662d91;&quot;&gt;Teamwork makes the stream work.&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-family: GothamBold,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Roku is changing how the world watches TV&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roku is the #1 TV streaming platform in the U.S., Canada, and Mexico, and we&#39;ve set our sights on powering every television in the world. Roku pioneered streaming to the TV. Our mission is to be the TV streaming platform that connects the entire TV ecosystem. We connect consumers to the content they love, enable content publishers to build and monetize large audiences, and provide advertisers unique capabilities to engage consumers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;From your first day at Roku, you&#39;ll make a valuable - and valued - contribution. We&#39;re a fast-growing public company where no one is a bystander. We offer you the opportunity to delight millions of TV streamers around the world while gaining meaningful experience across a variety of disciplines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-xl&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;heading-3&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;What does the team work on?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-200 my-2.5 last:mb-0 first:mt-0 &quot;&gt;The Roku Enterprise Engineering team is at the forefront of building a robust, integrated, and scalable platform that powers critical business processes across the organisation. As a cornerstone of Roku&#39;s corporate strategy, this team is instrumental in automating workflows across all Business Systems, including Supply Chain, Finance, Sales Operations, and Human Resources. By challenging traditional approaches to workflow automation, the team leverages cutting-edge engineering practices and API-driven design to streamline internal processes, boost efficiency, and deliver innovative solutions. The team&#39;s expertise spans a wide range of technologies, including Java and Python-based MicroServices, AWS/GCP cloud backend systems, Big Data technologies like Hive and Spark, and modern web applications. With a globally distributed presence across the US, India, and Europe, the team thrives on collaboration, bringing together diverse perspectives to solve complex challenges. At the heart of their success is a shared commitment to technical excellence, creativity, a strong sense of ownership, and a collaborative spirit that drives impactful results for Roku&#39;s business operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-xl&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;heading-3&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;What is the role?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-200 my-2.5 last:mb-0 first:mt-0 &quot;&gt;Roku is seeking a Senior Software Engineer to join the Enterprise Engineering team, focused on designing, building, and deploying scalable web applications and services that power critical business processes. In this role, you will serve as a platform services developer, building innovative solutions using modern software frameworks and paradigms across a multi-tier, distributed architecture. You will drive architecture discussions, take ownership of new projects, and deliver high-quality software within tight timelines. You will partner closely with security, compliance, and cross-functional teams to ensure applications meet audit, security, and compliance requirements. This role requires a self-driven problem solver with a strong background in building large-scale software platforms, microservices, and cloud-based systems. You will also contribute to the continual improvement of engineering tools, cloud-based technologies, and development processes, playing an integral role in shaping the team&#39;s technical direction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-xl&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;heading-3&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;How will I use AI at Roku?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-200 my-2.5 last:mb-0 first:mt-0 &quot;&gt;At Roku, AI agents do most of the keystroke-level coding. Engineers act as the technical leads for those agents — setting architecture, reviewing output, and ensuring everything meets Roku&#39;s quality bar. If you&#39;ve already shipped features where an AI agent wrote the initial code and you steered it to production, or you&#39;ve built fluency across the agentic engineering toolchain — coding harnesses like Claude Code or Cursor, MCP servers, custom skills, or agent frameworks. And you can describe a clear, repeatable workflow: how you prompt, how you scope tasks, how you drive an agent, verify its output, and ramp on an unfamiliar codebase with an agent helping you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-200 my-2.5 last:mb-0 first:mt-0 &quot;&gt;At Roku, we&#39;re embracing AI as a powerful tool to amplify human creativity, accelerate innovation, and deliver better results across the company. You already have experience using AI tools — or you&#39;re excited to learn how — to enhance your work, make smarter decisions, and collaborate more effectively. Whether you&#39;re in engineering, marketing, finance, HR, or any other team, AI will be part of how you work here. We want to talk to you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-xl&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;heading-3&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;What are the responsibilities of the role?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-inside list-disc whitespace-normal [li_&amp;amp;]:pl-6&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;unordered-list&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;Design, develop, and deploy scalable web applications and services, contributing to web technology and framework stack decisions, use case design, and data model design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;Drive architecture discussions, take ownership and responsibility over new projects, and deliver high-quality software within tight timelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;Partner with security and compliance teams to ensure applications meet compliance, security, and audit requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;Participate in the continual improvement of engineering tools, cloud-based technologies and services, and development processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;Define and participate in Agile development processes, including scoping, technical design, estimation, coding, testing, debugging, code reviews, maintenance, and support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams and demonstrate strong communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;Develop and maintain microservices using modern frameworks and cloud-native technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;Implement Infrastructure as Code (IaC) workflows to support reliable and repeatable deployments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-xl&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;heading-3&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;What experience would help someone be successful in this role at Roku?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-inside list-disc whitespace-normal [li_&amp;amp;]:pl-6&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;unordered-list&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;5+ years of experience delivering multi-tier, highly scalable, distributed web applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;Deep understanding of software architecture, object-oriented design principles, and data structures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;Strong experience with test-driven development and test automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;Extensive experience developing microservices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;Experience with Infrastructure as Code (IaC) workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;Demonstrated ability to be proactive, self-driven, and make practical trade-offs based on business needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#39;s or Master&#39;s degree in Computer Science or equivalent practical experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;Experience developing finance applications is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;Working experience with Terraform is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;Experience creating workflows for Apache Airflow is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h6 class=&quot;mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-sm&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;heading-6&quot;&gt;#LI-JB6&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: GothamBold, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;What&#39;s Roku&#39;s approach to hybrid working?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roku fosters an inclusive and collaborative environment where teams generally work in the office Monday through Thursday. Fridays are generally flexible for remote work, except for employees whose specific roles or assigned office location require five days&#39; a week attendance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-family: GothamBold,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What are some of the benefits?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roku is committed to offering a diverse range of benefits as part of our compensation package to support our employees and their families. Our comprehensive benefits include global access to mental health and financial wellness support and resources. Local benefits include statutory and voluntary benefits which may include healthcare (medical, dental, and vision), life, accident, disability, commuter, and retirement options (401(k)/pension). Employees are supported in taking time off, in accordance with local leave policies and other personal needs to support their evolving work and life needs. It&#39;s important to note that not every benefit is available in all locations or for every role. For details specific to your location, please consult with your recruiter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-family: GothamBold,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accommodations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roku welcomes applicants of all backgrounds and provides reasonable accommodations and adjustments in accordance with applicable law. If you require reasonable accommodation at any point in the hiring process, please direct your inquiries to &lt;a ----------
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-family: GothamBold,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What should I know about Roku&#39;s culture?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roku is a great place for people who want to work in a fast-paced environment where everyone is focused on the company&#39;s success rather than their own. We try to surround ourselves with people who are great at their jobs, who are easy to work with, and who keep their egos in check. We appreciate a sense of humor. We believe a fewer number of very talented folks can do more for less cost than a larger number of less talented teams. We&#39;re independent thinkers with big ideas who act boldly, move fast and accomplish extraordinary things through collaboration and trust. In short, at Roku you&#39;ll be part of a company that&#39;s changing how the world watches TV. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a unique culture that we are proud of. We think of ourselves primarily as problem-solvers, which itself is a two-part idea. We come up with the solution, but the solution isn&#39;t real until it is built and delivered to the customer. That penchant for action gives us a pragmatic approach to innovation, one that has served us well since 2002. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To learn more about Roku, our global footprint, and how we&#39;ve grown, visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.weareroku.com/factsheet&quot;&gt;https://www.weareroku.com/factsheet&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By providing your information, you acknowledge that you want Roku to contact you about job roles, that you have read Roku&#39;s &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.weareroku.com/roku-job-applicant-privacy-notice-for-job-applicants&quot;&gt;Applicant Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;, and understand that Roku will use your information as described in that notice. If you do not wish to receive any communications from Roku regarding this role or similar roles in the future, you may unsubscribe at any time by emailing &lt;a ----- -----<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set a new pulse for healthcare!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Software Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to join the &lt;strong&gt;DIAL&lt;/strong&gt; team in the &lt;strong&gt;Phone Assistant&lt;/strong&gt; domain.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your mission will be to design, build, and scale the AI-powered features that transform how practitioners and patients connect over the phone — making care more accessible for patients and reducing administrative burden for health professionals. You will work in a feature team developing the Phone Assistant, Doctolib&#39;s solution that combines LLM reasoning, speech recognition, and real-time backend systems, launching first in Germany and expanding to France and Italy.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working in the tech team at Doctolib means building innovative products and features to improve the daily lives of care teams and patients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your responsibilities include but are not limited to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and operate backend services in &lt;strong&gt;Node.js/TypeScript&lt;/strong&gt; (with Python exposure), designing for reliability, scalability, and real-time performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, evaluate, and ship &lt;strong&gt;LLM-based features&lt;/strong&gt; end-to-end: prompt engineering, tool calling, structured outputs, guardrails, and fallback strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own AI feature quality: build evaluation datasets and scorers (e.g., in Braintrust), track regressions, and make evidence-based ship decisions before each release&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deploy and operate cloud-native services on &lt;strong&gt;Kubernetes&lt;/strong&gt; across major cloud providers (AWS/Azure/GCP), and evolve CI/CD pipelines with &lt;strong&gt;GitHub Actions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design data models and drive database migrations and performance tuning for real-time workloads (&lt;strong&gt;PostgreSQL&lt;/strong&gt;: connection pooling, indexing, query optimisation)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a high testing bar (unit, integration, e2e), debug distributed systems in production with strong observability, and contribute to pragmatic, secure architecture decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Before you read on: if you don&#39;t have the exact profile described below, but you feel this job description matches your skill set, we still encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll be a great fit if you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have 5+ years of backend engineering experience building scalable, resilient systems in &lt;strong&gt;Node.js/TypeScript&lt;/strong&gt; (with some Python)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have hands-on production experience building LLM-based features: prompting, tool calling, structured outputs, eval frameworks, and handling real-world failure modes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have proven experience deploying and operating services on &lt;strong&gt;Kubernetes&lt;/strong&gt; within at least one major cloud provider (AWS, Azure, or GCP), with solid CI/CD practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a strong testing culture (unit/integration/e2e), sharp debugging skills for microservices and distributed systems, and a focus on code quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are fluent in English, with a collaborative mindset and the drive to own problems end-to-end — from design to production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;It would be fantastic if you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience with speech pipelines (ASR, TTS, streaming audio) or voice agents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are familiar with event-driven architectures and message brokers (Kafka, RabbitMQ, NATS, or Redis Streams), and have hands-on PostgreSQL experience (EXPLAIN/ANALYZE, indexing strategies, connection pooling)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have an interest in telephony and real-time communication (SIP, RTP, WebRTC) — no prior experience needed, we will teach you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at Doctolib Tech&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our solutions are built on a single fully cloud-native platform that supports web and mobile app interfaces, multiple languages, and is adapted to country and healthcare specialty requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our stack is composed of Rails, TypeScript, Java, Python, Kotlin, Swift, and React Native.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We leverage AI ethically across our products to empower patients and health professionals. Discover our AI vision&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.doctolib.com/ai-careers/&quot;&gt; here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Want to learn more about our tech culture and environment? Visit the&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.doctolib.com/tech-doctolib/&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Doctolib Tech site&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A Deutschlandticket (Germany-wide public transport pass) fully paid for by Doctolib&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;28 vacation days + 1 additional day for each full calendar year of employment (up to a maximum of 30 days)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work from abroad for up to 10 days per year thanks to our flexibility days policy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company health insurance with great supplementary benefits through our partner Allianz&lt;/li&gt;
